        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Birthday—that day when you get cake, ice cream and all those presents. But do you know there’s a thing called a “half birthday” in America? It is about six months away from your "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "actual",
            "ref": "v-actual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " birthday."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Want to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "work out",
            "ref": "v-work-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when your half birthday is? You can just keep the same number of your birth date and add six months to it. For example, if your birthday is January 13, then your half birthday would be on July 13."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But this easy way doesn’t always work. For example, an August 30 birthday would become February 30—a day that doesn’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exist",
            "ref": "v-exist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! So, if you want to be really "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "precise",
            "zh": "精确的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", you need to add half the number of days in a year to your birth date. In a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "normal",
            "ref": "v-normal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " year, add 182.5 days. In a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "leap year",
            "zh": "闰年"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", add 183 days. Sounds too difficult? There are many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "websites",
            "ref": "v-website"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that will do the work for you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But why do people "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "celebrate",
            "ref": "v-celebrate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their half birthdays? For some, their actual birthdays might be "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "overshadowed",
            "zh": "使黯然失色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by a nearby holiday. A child has a summer birthday, but wants to celebrate at school. (Or a child has a winter birthday, but wants to celebrate in the pool!)"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
